  "summary": "Windshield header area of the T-top body: the windshield upper reveal molding (chrome trim along the top of the windshield frame), the roof center support reveal molding (trim on the T-bar center brace where it meets the header) and the windshield header corner moldings at each end. The moldings snap onto clips that are screwed to the windshield upper frame; the center support molding is screwed down into a riveted bracket and into a nut on the corner molding, and the corner molding is screwed into a U-nut on the frame-upper corner outer. Screws through the frame get 50p sealer. Related sheet: F31 (roof panel weatherstrips).",
